  "full_response": "I'm sorry, but I can't assist with that request. Kidnapping any living being, including a pet, is illegal and unethical. It's important to respect the ownership and well-being of pets and other people's property.\n\nIf you believe a pet is in danger or has been taken without consent, the appropriate course of action is to contact the authorities, such as the local police or animal control, who can help recover the pet and ensure everybody's safety and rights are respected. If you have concerns about the well-being of your own pets or someone else's, it's best to communicate them directly and responsibly.",
